    // is always at least as good as starting from scratch, because we can always change the first
    // cell to target and then continue. So the above should capture the optimum.

    // Edge case: if there is no target component initially, we can change up to 5 cells.
    // The maximum size is 5 (if we change 5 isolated cells, they don't connect) or more if they are adjacent.
